      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    units_sold = 350\n    selling_price = 40\n    inventory = [(200, 30), (150, 25), (100, 20)]  # newest batch first\n\n    revenue = units_sold * selling_price\n    remaining_units = units_sold\n    cogs = 0\n\n    for quantity, unit_cost in inventory:\n        units_from_batch = min(remaining_units, quantity)\n        cogs += units_from_batch * unit_cost\n        remaining_units -= units_from_batch\n        if remaining_units == 0:\n            break\n\n    gross_profit = revenue - cogs\n    return round(gross_profit)\n```",
